# Layer A density v4 fixture: 41-toggle-machine using nested expressions
# inside FIELD_LIST compact-form values (Agent A's Slice 10).
#
# Two intermediate declarations (negatedState, emptyOutputsV) collapse into
# the FIELD_LIST entries `state=(APP not [s])` and `outputs=(PV emptyOutputsT
# [])`. The PRC annotations on LAM are retained because Agent B's compact-
# form-param inference doesn't walk into nested expressions to discover
# `s` and `e`'s use sites (a follow-up to combine the two streams).
#
# Round-trip: canonical hash equals 41-toggle-machine.json's.
@v=1 root=toggleMachine
emptyOutputsT PRD []
stateFieldT PRF "state" boolT
outputsFieldT PRF "outputs" emptyOutputsT
resultT PRD [stateFieldT outputsFieldT]
transitionFnT FNT [boolT unitT] resultT
transitionResult PV resultT [state=(APP not [s]) outputs=(PV emptyOutputsT [])]
transitionLambda LAM [s:boolT e:unitT] transitionResult
inputStream ESE unitT
toggleMachine SM transitionLambda false [inputStream] [] [receiveFx]
